<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Guest Supply downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Guest Supply downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- NatWest Securities said it downgraded Guest Supply Inc to neutral from buy.</p>
<p>-- Earlier the company said it does not expect to meet analysts' estimates for the year.</p>
<p>-- The stock was off 1/8 to 13-5/8.</p>
</text>
